1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,500
Will this lander survive at this lunar south-pole site, on these dates?

2
00:00:04,500 --> 00:00:09,500
Real LOLA terrain horizon; Sun and Earth from NASA SPICE, checked with JPL Horizons.

3
00:00:09,500 --> 00:00:13,000
Pick a site: Malapert Massif, an Artemis III region.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Hour by hour: with a 20 kWh battery at 2 m it does not survive 2027.

5
00:00:17,500 --> 00:00:21,500
Raise panel and antenna to 10 m: it survives.

6
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:26,000
A 10 m mast cuts the battery needed from 24.1 to 14.1 kWh.

7
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Find the best landing days. Lander values: unconfirmed.
